invariant: INV-16
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: quic_loop_widemul
reason: the client's hybrid secret, ML-KEM decapsulation and the x25519 half,
  runs under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever it answered. The secret is
  the same. test/quic_loop_widemul.h runs the webpki client, which
  selects the hybrid, and requires a client that answers
  CH_WIDEMUL_CONSTANT_TIME to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    uint8_t widemul = widemul_answer(&h->t->cfg);
--- new
    uint8_t widemul = CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED;
